==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nazousagi (Enemy)|Nazousagi]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

